[{"answer":"Good morning, Synmouth Museum. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm interested in the children's workshops and I'd like a little more information, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you mean the Art and Craft workshops?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. A friend of a friend mentioned them -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"the children do painting and make models and so forth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, where to begin?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, as you probably know, they run every Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. And what about ages?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, all ages from five upwards are welcome,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"though we do ask that children below eight years of age are accompanied by an adult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. That wouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What about cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think you'll find them very reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £2.50 a child,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"with 80 pence off for two or more children from the same family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, very reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And are they held in the main museum?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Not exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"They're nearby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you give me the full address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know the area very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's Winter House.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's in Tamer Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you spell that please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, TAMER Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And I do need to tell you that there's a security entrance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so you need to press the green button for someone to let you in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't press the red button please,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/32.mp3"},{"answer":"but don't worry, it's all clearly labelled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. And one more question -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/34.mp3"},{"answer":"is parking available nearby?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/35.mp3"},{"answer":"We're driving in from out of town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Your best bet is to leave your car at the back of the library -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/37.mp3"},{"answer":"on a Saturday morning, there are plenty of spaces there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's right next door to the museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And can I ask about booking places?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and I must tell you, you really should book by calling the education department here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm sorry, should I have rung them instead of the main museum number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/42.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's fine this time, please don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/43.mp3"},{"answer":"But for future reference, I'll give you the direct number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 200765.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, I've got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/46.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm very happy to give you information about the next two workshops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/47.mp3"},{"answer":"On Saturday the 16th, there's Building Castles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, sounds great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/49.mp3"},{"answer":"This involves quite a bit of glue, so just make sure the kids are in old clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, ones I don't mind getting mucky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And if possible, could you bring along bottle tops","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/53.mp3"},{"answer":"which the children might be able to use in the models, you know, as decoration?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/54.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll certainly try to find some for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the following week...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/56.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be the 23rd, won't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/58.mp3"},{"answer":"On that day, it's what we call Undersea Worlds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/59.mp3"},{"answer":"This is where they make scenes with fishes, underground caverns and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that likely to get very dirty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Lots of paint splashes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really, so we don't recommend any special clothes for that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/63.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you could search out some silver paper to bring along to use in the sessions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/64.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, it's shiny - it looks like water, that'd be great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course. We'll see what we can come up with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thank you ever so much for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/67.mp3"},{"answer":"The sessions sound really good and I'll certainly book up for the next two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much for ringing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye-bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-1-2023-08-02-09-32-11/72.mp3"}]
